4
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:59,120
Let me go!

5
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:01,960
Let me go!

6
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,360
If you don't talk now,

7
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,480
