8
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:18,840
It's okay.

9
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,120
Who are you?

10
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:24,200
What right do you have to bring me here?

11
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,200
Have the police speak to me.

12
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,120
No one in the Stellarport dares to do so.

13
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,440
What is this place?

14
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,760
It's terrifying.

15
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,160
Who are you?

16
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:17,400
I'm Officer Chen from Stellarport Police Department.

17
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:18,440
Jin Junyi.

18
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:21,080
The police now strongly suspect

19
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,840
