Quite the big talker.

30
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:44,960
Evidence?

31
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,480
It's coming right up.

32
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,320
The evidence is here.

33
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,000
I deserve it!

34
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,200
I shouldn't have trusted you.

35
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,400
Otherwise,

36
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:14,720
Huo Jia wouldn't have broken up with me.

37
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,800
What did I hide?

38
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:20,840
I hid the evidence of your murder,

39
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,280
the most important thing

40
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:25,200
