41
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,800
And you'll never find it in your lifetime.

42
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:31,720
Xie Zhengyan.

43
00:04:32,400 --> 00:04:33,800
Who do you think you are?

44
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,280
You're lower than a dog.

45
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,360
Daring to order me around?

46
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,880
