56
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,400
Liluo?

57
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:09,680
You're not worthy of saying her name.

58
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:11,640
You bastard!

59
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,840
Bastard!

60
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:26,880
Second Uncle,

61
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:28,960
