73
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,680
Don't blame me for being ruthless then.

74
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,400
Okay, okay.

75
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:58,600
I'll go with Zhengnian right now to get the best materials.

76
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,960
No more trouble, I promise.

77
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:02,920
Good.

78
00:06:08,720 --> 00:06:09,560
Xie Zhengyan.

79
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:13,400
You can never hide

80
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:16,160
