84
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,600
Xie Zhengyan, you idiot!

85
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:29,760
Trying to send me to prison?

86
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:32,600
You should stay here for the rest of your life.

87
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,040
Zhengnian.

88
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:37,160
Go meet up with Lu Gao.

89
00:06:38,720 --> 00:06:39,520
Huan.

90
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,080
Why not just kill

91
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,120
this man?

92
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:45,120
You just can't keep your composure.

93
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:48,360
Don't you see how confident he looks?

94
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,760
Don't act rashly.

95
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:18,560
Still playing tough?

96
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:22,120
You're asking for punishment.

97
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:24,680
I'll figure out to get

98
