99
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:28,000
Going public is a big deal.

100
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,080
No delay allowed.

101
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:57,240
Of course.

102
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:03,200
You two scheming bastards!

103
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:04,680
Kang Qingtian,

104
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:06,320
