114
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,240
Hao.

115
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,040
What are you doing?

116
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:39,600
Let go of me! Let go!

117
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,960
