118
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:47,600
We need the password from Jin Junyi to open it.

119
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,520
What folder?

120
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,720
Why should I tell you?

121
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:53,160
That's private.

122
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,520
Who are you to touch my laptop?

123
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:56,240
I'm Yan Xiaoxiao's brother.

124
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:58,120
I have the right to gather evidence for the police.

125
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:03,560
Speak up.

126
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:05,320
What exactly is hidden in that folder?

127
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,800
What folder?

128
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,160
I was performing,

129
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:09,400
I didn't save anything.

130
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,160
Someone told me

131
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:14,120
to bring the laptop to the studio this afternoon.

132
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,960
How would I know where that folder came from?

133
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:19,160
Tell me,

134
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:22,160
