135
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,040
Let go! Let go now!

136
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,520
Why should I tell you?

137
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,840
You bastards!  -Chen Sir,

138
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,920
stop wasting time on this idiot.

139
00:10:30,240 --> 00:10:31,960
He's just a fool being used.

140
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:33,400
Let's just open it.

141
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,160
Open it.

142
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,200
What's the big deal?

143
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,440
I haven't done anything.

144
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,440
Don't touch that laptop.

145
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:41,400
