146
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:44,920
Girlfriend?

147
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:46,280
Then who is she?

148
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,920
We won't open

149
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,680
