150
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,120
Point it out for us.

151
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,080
Of course, I have a girlfriend.

152
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,920
Don't open that LL folder.

153
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:03,560
She's the heiress of Zhengyan Group,

154
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,000
Liluo,

155
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:07,440
