162
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:24,840
But if we open this XX folder

163
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:28,320
and find videos of you harming Xiaoxiao,

164
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:31,520
you'll go to jail.

165
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:33,920
If you were coerced,

166
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:35,920
