168
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,200
How could I possibly go to jail?

169
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,880
My uncle is your superior,

170
00:11:42,920 --> 00:11:43,840
Deputy Director Rick.

171
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,320
You wouldn't dare!

172
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:50,800
There's blood on the ground.

173
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:53,560
Not a false alarm.

174
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:59,400
The person was taken away.

175
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:06,760
Who are you?

176
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:11,000
Officer, I'm their tutor Cherry Wong.

177
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:13,040
There was a fight here earlier.

178
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:16,440
Cheng Lei, scan the area

179
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:18,040
for any suspicious individuals.

180
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,000
Got it.

181
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:32,800
The janitor said

182
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,080
several students

183
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:36,800
got into a physical altercation with the relatives of the girl who fell.

184
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:39,880
Both parties went to Zhengyan Bay Hospital.

185
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:42,400
The bystanders have all dispersed now.

186
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,240
To cooperate with the investigation,

187
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:45,600
Miss Wong,

188
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:47,680
