189
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:50,200
Why?

190
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:59,280
Alright.

191
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:07,040
Stand down.

192
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:08,720
Return to headquarters immediately.

193
00:13:11,760 --> 00:13:12,560
Understood,

194
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,040
Rick.

195
00:13:16,840 --> 00:13:17,640
Miss Wong,

196
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:19,560
