197
00:13:20,280 --> 00:13:21,560
You may go now.

198
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,360
I know about your uncle,

199
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:33,760
that's why

200
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,480
you're only a suspect now,

201
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:37,320
not a criminal.

202
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:40,840
Just answer my questions.

203
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:45,440
This is just a routine investigation according to due process.

204
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:47,720
You don't have the right to remain silent.

205
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,680
Evidence suggests

206
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:52,400
