208
00:13:58,320 --> 00:13:59,800
This is against you.

209
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:08,240
Hey, Junyi?

210
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:09,240
It's Amina.

211
00:14:09,280 --> 00:14:10,040
Amina,

212
00:14:10,640 --> 00:14:13,000
