214
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:15,280
My treat.

215
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:18,360
Okay, Junyi, we'll come.

216
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:24,520
Why hasn't Gao Mei'er come out of the bathroom yet?

217
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,240
Amina, you're treating?

218
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,520
I'm not.

219
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:30,640
Jin Junyi's treating.

220
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:33,920
Yan Xiaoxiao.

221
00:14:34,200 --> 00:14:35,080
Get over here.

222
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:36,480
Tonight,

223
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:39,280
I'm taking you and Gao Mei'er to a fun place.

224
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,760
I have something to do tonight.

225
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:43,000
Can I not go?

226
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:43,800
No.

227
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,800
All our classmates will be there.

228
00:14:46,680 --> 00:14:47,680
You have to go, no matter what.  -Let's go.

229
00:14:47,920 --> 00:14:48,960
I don't want to go.  -Let's go.

230
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,720
Did Amina leak it?

231
00:15:00,840 --> 00:15:02,040
You have to believe

232
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:04,160
