233
00:15:04,960 --> 00:15:07,160
Otherwise, I would've taken you back to the police station already.

234
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:08,880
Right now, you are

235
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:10,400
a student,

236
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:12,480
still have a bright future ahead.

237
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:13,520
I advise you

238
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:15,320
not to be used by bad people.

239
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,520
Otherwise, even your uncle

240
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:20,520
will be implicated.
